ess(processId)` function in `index.html` and `backend.py`. It calls `self.db.delete_process(process_id)` and reloads history.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"type d:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\\\\desktop_app\\\\backend.py | findstr /C:\\\"OPEN_DIALOG\\\" /C:\\\"FOLDER_DIALOG\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"d:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"500","toolAction":"\"Check deprecated dialog usage\"","toolSummary":"\"Check backend.py\""}}]}
